-- ============================================================================
-- Migration 61 DOWN: no-op.
--
-- Migration 61 is a data backfill (NONE -> sensible default) on existing rows.
-- There is no faithful inverse — re-setting the fields to NONE would re-break
-- the strict-typed schema (and the original NONEs were drift, not intent). Down
-- intentionally does nothing; the data stays valid.
-- ============================================================================
